    "name": "Mesa Partner Authentication Invoices API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for Mesa partners. Exchange your API keys (clientId/clientSecret) for a short-lived Bearer/JWT session token scoped to one of your end users, then retrieve that user's invoices. The minted token also powers the embedded Mesa UI (MesaClient) iframe handshake.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Mesa Support\n Email: support@joinmesa.com",
